# Background: (v0.2) conditions run before every block of the screen, in order; And when:
# composes the conditions of a block. The coupon block fails on purpose.
Screen: Checkout
  Background: The user is signed in
  Background: The cart has an item

  Element: Summary
    Show: Greeting
    And: Item count

  Element: Pay Button
    When: An address is entered
    And when: A card is entered
    Enable

    When: An address is entered
    Disable

    When: An address is entered
    And when: An expired card is entered
    Disable

  Element: Coupon
    When: An address is entered
    And when: A coupon is applied
    Show: Discount
